---
// Ekonomik Seri — /segmentler/ekonomik-seri. Third and final page of the
// "Segmentler" series (see header.data.ts's brandsMega third column) —
// completing the brandsMega mega menu's "Segmentler" column entirely
// (three genuinely new pages: Premium Seri, Standart Seri, Ekonomik
// Seri; plus three menu items already wired to existing devicesMega
// content on Premium Seri: Şarj Edilebilir Seri, Görünmez Seri, Çocuk
// Serisi). Same candidacy-based content genre as Premium Seri and
// Standart Seri.
//
// The TechEvolution "stage" slot reuses the same genuine three-rung tier
// ladder used on the two prior siblings (Ekonomik -> Standart ->
// Premium), with "bestFor" swapped to "Bu sayfanın konusu" on the
// Ekonomik rung. The KulakArkasiComparison table deliberately does NOT
// repeat the Standart-vs-Ekonomik pair already covered on Standart
// Seri's own comparison (same sides, just swapped, would be redundant);
// instead it pivots to the axis genuinely specific to this
// price-sensitive segment — an orijinal ekonomik-seri cihaz vs. a
// non-original "cheap" imitation — the same technique the dB-degree
// ladder pages used for their own final rung. This also ties the
// Segmentler series back to the "Neden Orijinal" series' own Güvenilir
// Teknoloji page.
//
// accentColor: yeşil / green-600 (#16a34a) — third and final color in
// the fresh accent rotation opened for this series on Premium Seri's
// hero.ts; see that file for the full rationale.
//
// 14-section flow, in order: Hero -> Nedir? -> Kimler İçin Uygun? ->
// Avantajları -> Dikkat Edilmesi Gerekenler -> Seri Karşılaştırması
// (Ekonomik/Standart/Premium ladder) -> Öne Çıkan Özellikler ->
// Teknolojiler -> Markalara Göre İnceleyin -> Orijinal Ekonomik Seri vs
// Orijinal Olmayan Ucuz Ürün -> Uzman Yorumu -> SSS -> Premium CTA ->
// İlgili İçerikler.
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import BrandPageHero from "../../components/brand-page/BrandPageHero/BrandPageHero.astro";
